<title>MEXICO: GFSerfin Q2 net profit 89 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>GFSerfin Q2 net profit 89 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grupo Financiero Serfin, Mexico's third largest banking group, reported a net profit of 89 million pesos in the second quarter, and its bank unit Banca Serfin notched up profits of $101 million.</p>
<p>Serfin gave no comparative figures.</p>
<p>It said the bank's capitalization ratio during the quarter was 13.4 percent, above the 9 percent it said it needed.</p>
</text>
